# The images built with the repository root as their context are the vault exporter's
# (infra/images/vault-exporter) and the deposit indexer's (infra/images/deposit-indexer):
# their sources go in, nothing else. Chain data, keys and passwords in .devnet, contract
# builds and libraries never reach a build.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/vault-exporter
!cmd/deposit-indexer
!internal/vaultwatch
!internal/ledger
!internal/deposits
!internal/suspense
